--- a/docs/cli.rst
+++ b/docs/cli.rst
@@ -481,6 +481,11 @@ If your data is in CSV format, you can insert it using the ``--csv`` option::
 
     $ sqlite-utils insert dogs.db dogs docs.csv --csv
 
+Use ``--delimiter`` for CSV data that uses a delimiter other than a comma. This
+option implies ``--csv``::
+
+    $ sqlite-utils insert dogs.db dogs docs.csv --delimiter=';'
+
 For tab-delimited data, use ``--tsv``::
 
     $ sqlite-utils insert dogs.db dogs docs.tsv --tsv
